Provenance
----------
The default note templates are written from a description of the note style
and contain no text copied from GPL-licensed template files.

Third-party material bundled with this product
-----------------------------------------------

Most color themes in crates/codewiki-app/themes/ are copied from the gpui-kit
project (https://github.com/longbridge/gpui-kit), Copyright 2024-2026
Longbridge, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. They were changed
in one way: color keys that gpui-kit 0.9.1 does not read were renamed to the
keys it reads, or removed where it has no such key. No color value was
changed. Each theme file names the author and source of its palette in its
"author" and "url" fields.

The theme files dracula.json, github.json, nord.json, one.json and
rose-pine.json were written for CodeWiki. They use the color values published
by the palette authors named in each file (Dracula, GitHub Primer, Nord,
Atom One, Rosé Pine), whose projects are MIT licensed.

The OpenUI Lang parser in crates/openui-lang is an independent implementation
of the language defined by https://github.com/thesysdev/openui (MIT,
Copyright Thesys Inc.). Its behavior was checked against that project's
reference parser; no source from it is included.

Dependencies under the Mozilla Public License 2.0 (for example cssparser, used
by the Mermaid renderer) are used unmodified as libraries. Their source is
available from crates.io.
